        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: William Grant Still, Verna Arvey\n- Works: A Bayou Legend\n- Topics: American opera, composition\n\nFacts:\n- William Grant Still was an American composer who lived from May 11, 1895, to December 3, 1978.\n- William Grant Still composed more than 150 works, including five symphonies and eight operas.\n- A Bayou Legend is an American opera composed by William Grant Still.\n- Verna Arvey, the wife and frequent collaborator of William Grant Still, wrote the libretto for A Bayou Legend.",
